OL,3,GNEWSAMet 'reset' means fewer police at
OL,4,Amajor events
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "resetting" of policing priorities in
OL,7,FLondon will mean that some incidents at
OL,8,Fmajor events and protests will now
OL,9,F"take longer to squash", the
OL,10,FMetropolitan Police has said.
OL,12,FCommissioner Sir Mark Rowley told a
OL,13,Fsession of the London Assembly that
OL,14,Fofficers were being moved away from
OL,15,Fpolicing major events and into
OL,16,Fcommunity policing instead.
OL,18,FThe decision, he said, freed up 6,000
OL,19,Fshifts in October.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
